Package: mod-nats
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, freeswitch (>= 1.10) | freeswitch-all
Description: NATS message bus control plane for FreeSWITCH
 mod_nats gives FreeSWITCH a NATS-bus control plane: JSON-RPC 2.0 call
 control (Accept/Answer/Hangup/Play/Record/DetectSpeech/Transfer/Hold/
 ThreeWay/...), channel events, CDR and metrics publishing, with media
 staying on FreeSWITCH. XNode.* aliases are compatible with the XCC
 protocol; ESL is untouched and stays the ops channel.
